its branch company was established in Dec 2018.EZSVS and its branch is one of the leading IDC Integrated Service Provider. Business in EZSVS covers IDC consultation &amp; management, IDC planning and construction, system integration, Server installation and maintenance, IDC talent development, industrial research, infrastructure &amp; system integration, IDC O&amp;M outsourcing service etc. Over the years EZSVS adhere to the &quot;quality first, credit first, customer first, integrity-based&quot; operating principles of customer service.</span></div><div class="_1595km00 _11epkyf5h _11epkyfp _11epkyfi _11epkyf0 _11epkyf6" data-testid="readmore-measure-preview" aria-hidden="true"><span class="_1595km00 _11epkyf4x _11epkyfr _1yc463g0 _1yc463g1 _1yc463g1t _1yc463g8 _18yaz4f4 _1acm36c0"><span class="_1595km00 _1acm36c2 _11epkyf4x _11epkyf0 _11epkyfr _1acm36c4" style="--_1acm36c3:3">EZSVS Established in March 2005, and PT.EZSVS Technology Indonesia as its branch company was established in Dec 2018.EZSVS and its branch is one of the leading IDC Integrated Service Provider. Business in EZSVS covers IDC consultation &amp; management, IDC planning and construction, system integration, Server installation and maintenance, IDC talent development, industrial research, infrastructure &amp; system integration, IDC O&amp;M outsourcing service etc. Over the years EZSVS adhere to the &quot;quality first, credit first, customer first, integrity-based&quot; operating principles of customer service.</span></span></div><span class="_1595km00 _11epkyf4x _11epkyfr _1yc463g0 _1yc463g1 _1yc463g1t _1yc463g8 _18yaz4f4 _1acm36c0"><span class="_1595km00 _1acm36c2 _11epkyf4x _11epkyf0 _11epkyfr _1acm36c4" style="--_1acm36c3:3">EZSVS Established in March 2005, and PT.EZSVS Technology Indonesia as its branch company was established in Dec 2018.EZSVS and its branch is one of the leading IDC Integrated Service Provider. Business in EZSVS covers IDC consultation &amp; management, IDC planning and con